ueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Cocktail Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Cocktail Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"i6YvzoCYT6vCxBxqD7nR-g","review_id":"YpYs0zLwyYPcJx-nDx_hQw","date":"2013-04-02T18:14:14","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9609249234199524,"text_excerpt":"Located in The Roosevelt hotel, Sazerac bar is a historic gem that will give you the feeling of class and sophistication upon entering. The attentive bartenders, and carefully crafted drink menu, are worth a visit to Sazerac - especially for the namesake drink that I was too much of a pansy to try. I did, however, leave with a Sazerac souvenir glass. The bartender told us they charge $13 for the glass, but most people just steal 'em. Not surprising considering the price! Although our bar tab didn't include the cost of the glass, we paid for it assuming that the bartender would pocket the extra cash. Usually, dishonesty such as this would set me off. I didn't care, I don't know why, maybe ..."},{"business_id":"i6YvzoCYT6vCxBxqD7nR-g","review_id":"OSARQt2rJkeiszyxJAwovQ","date":"2022-01-08T06:07:01","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9525450468063354,"text_excerpt":"Holy shit this place is fucking amazing. In the event that you don't know, the drink that is widely considered to be the first cocktail ever invented, is now the name of this bar which is THE place to get it. The decor is interesting, kinda old-school classy realness. The bartenders are in shirt, tie, and vest. It's located inside the Roosevelt Hotel. The sazerac itself (sazerac cognac, absinthe, peychaud's bitters, and sugar) is gross to me personally but I'm like a toddler when it comes to my alcoholic beverages and prefer to drink candy and milkshakes. My GF who has a more sophisticated alcohol palate enjoyed it. I, on the other hand, tried the ramos gin fizz which is another famous Ne..."},{"business_id":"i6YvzoCYT6vCxBxqD7nR-g","review_id":"bfJRFp13BrKlySPEA7TQjw","date":"2014-10-01T00:24:50","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9522199630737305,"text_excerpt":"The signature Sazerac is bar none, the best sazerac I had in town. It was executed very well, not too sweet, not too dry. Also, the gin fizz was fantastic. Bartenders really know what they're doing here. Lastly, the atmosphere at the bar and the Roosevelt hotel is great."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"i6YvzoCYT6vCxBxqD7nR-g","photo_id":"5hxJgvHAScSPOTO_4_v0Bw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/5hxJgvHAScSPOTO_4_v0Bw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9063507318496704},{"business_id":"i6YvzoCYT6vCxBxqD7nR-g","photo_id":"gM-pQ2AXb5JcPY2ISiQ4Aw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/gM-pQ2AXb5JcPY2ISiQ4Aw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8953576683998108},{"business_id":"i6YvzoCYT6vCxBxqD7nR-g","photo_id":"gfWKP65ZB_3l5a_wR5TxaA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/gfWKP65ZB_3l5a_wR5TxaA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8855026960372925},{"business_id":"i6YvzoCYT6vCxBxqD7nR-g","photo_id":"HIyYyWokIp2eC-Orw0foyQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/HIyYyWokIp2eC-Orw0foyQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8367959260940552},{"business_id":"i6YvzoCYT6vCxBxqD7nR-g","photo_id":"jaO84A_spXbXSsDo6Y7OLA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/jaO84A_spXbXSsDo6Y7OLA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8256248235702515}]},"notebook_case":null}
